  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that three dice are thrown.</p><p>The total number of outcomes when three dice are thrown together is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn></math>.</p><p>The number of outcomes such that all the outcomes are different is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn></math>.</p><p>For ex: If the outcome in dice&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><msup><mn>6</mn><mo>&#34;</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;then the number of outcomes for dice&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;should be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;which excludes the outcome&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><msup><mn>6</mn><mo>&#34;</mo></msup></math>.</p><p>Hence, the required probability is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Therefore, the required answer is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>.</p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
